OL,3,GNEWSAGaps in evidence on vaccinating
OL,4,Abadgers against TB, researchers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are "significant gaps" in
OL,7,Fknowledge and evidence about the effect
OL,8,Fof vaccinating badgers in Wales against
OL,9,Fbovine tuberculosis (TB), according to
OL,10,Fresearchers.
OL,12,FA team from the British Ecological
OL,13,FSociety's Wales policy group, along
OL,14,Fwith staff from Cardiff and Aberystwyth
OL,15,Funiversities, argue the gaps reduce the
OL,16,Feffectiveness of this method of trying
OL,17,Fto deal with the disease.
OL,19,FVaccination is part of a programme to
OL,20,Feradicate bovine TB in Wales, but it is
OL,21,Fa controversial topic.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
